RADAR_FRESH_START_V1

This file explicitly authorises ONE clean scanner bootstrap from the packaged 200-item baseline.

The bootstrap is valid only while radar.json also contains fresh_repository_seed=v1, exactly
200 active Strand A+B records, no A/B archive, no Strand C, no scan_state, no scan_history,
and no previous scan timestamp. The first successful scan removes the JSON seed marker,
creates this repository's own scan_state/cursors/scan_history, and the workflow then deletes
this FRESH_START file in the same commit.

It does NOT weaken normal scanner security after bootstrap.
